# Maintainer-local working state (CCPR dogfooding its own conventions).
# The repo ships docs/ as framework content; these are session artefacts, not
# distribution. Keeping them untracked also keeps tenant identifiers out of
# shipped artefacts (Constitution, Inviolable "No personal or tenant data").
# Decision drafts are extracted into a de-personalised ADR under docs/adr/.
docs/HANDOVER.md
docs/.handover-archive/
docs/decisions/
